Z||000000||72vinman||07-15-2001||12:34 AM||||I have always admired the fiero. When I was younger I thought it just looked cool. When I was in my late teens I was intrigued with the idea of a V6 powering such a small car. I am a little bit older now and I was looking to get a third car to have a little fun with in the summer. So I started searching for my new Fiero (still have not found one yet). Over the last three weeks I have visited over 100 web sites dedicated to people and there Fiero's and just recently finding this forum. After reading many of the posts here over the last few days I find it refreshing to see the great sense of community develop among all you Fiero owners. I think this is fabulous and a little unbelievable. But it makes me want to own a Fiero that much more so I can truly contribute as all of you have. Thanks for reading. 72vinman@home.com||||reg||14
